                    "s4_title" => "Triads",
                    "s4_content" => "Your triad is another way of describing how you consistently interpret and respond to life. They are also known as the “Centers Of Intelligence” and are made up of three sets of three Enneagram types. Types 2, 3, and 4 are in the heart or feeling triad, types 5, 6, and 7 are in the head or thought triad, and types 8, 9, and 1 can be found in the gut or instinct triad.",
