                        "<b><span>3 -</span> Seeks to take on the identity of the most successful and accomplished person -</b> They believe they are only as good as their last accomplishment and when they are not viewed as successful or have trouble defining their identity they will aim to transform into what their peers or surroundings say they should be.",
                        "<b><span>4 -</span> Seeks to be seen as the most special and unique person -</b> They will constantly seek opportunities to prove they are unique or not normal and mundane. If they are compared or have their work compared to others they will feel a lack of identity or like their identity is being taken away from them."
